// WHY THIS FILE EXISTS: this repo is not one project. It is 62 independently
// runnable leaves, each with its own pyproject.toml and .venv, and deliberately
// no uv workspace tying them together. basedpyright runs as ONE process rooted
// here; without an executionEnvironments entry per leaf it resolves every leaf
// against nothing and reports spurious unresolved-import errors across the tree.
//
// WHY THE SUPPRESSIONS ARE HERE AND NOT IN THE LEAVES: every leaf pyproject.toml
// carries an identical [tool.basedpyright] table. Those tables are INERT for
// nvim, VS Code and Claude Code -- all three root the checker at the repo, and a
// nested pyproject.toml is never read at that root. Measured on
// M3_models_registry/1_models_flavors_signatures: 0 errors rooted at the leaf,
// 6 errors + 153 warnings rooted here. The three report* keys below are those
// tables, lifted to the root where they actually apply.
